  message: "Shipped in PR #3722. Two false-positive warnings eliminated: (1) Circom skip warning gated on .circom file presence in tree, (2) DEPENDENCY/toml_dependencies partial-install warning suppressed when neither Rust nor Python detected (via new per-requirement language-relevance gate in partial_install_warnings.py). CGO/LUA_FFI/RUBY_FFI were already gated correctly by WI-zamoz. Four new tests; 100% coverage; full 12179-test suite passes."  # 3b1b
